# From "Energy Bar Tool" (Wave II - Threshold, CD3-5). The tape cycles
# through six colors one at a time (orange, yellow, green, blue, red, back to
# white); condensed here into one pass through the sequence rather than six
# near-identical build-ups. Prerequisite for living-body-map.gws, which
# reaches for this tool by name.

@segment   energy-bar-tool
@title     The Energy Bar Tool
@levels    F10
@duration  ~2m30s
@protected Energy Bar Tool

say Now, construct your first energy tool. Visualise a small spot of light — white, glowing, sparkling.
pause 6
say Stretch it out into a white line. Then thicken it into a straight, round bar of sparkling white light.
pause 8
say Look at it closely. Pick it up. Hold it. Feel the glowing energy, and move it around until you're familiar with it. This is your Energy Bar Tool.
pause 10
say Now make it change color. Sparkling orange.
pause 5
say Back to sparkling white.
pause 4
say Sparkling yellow.
pause 5
say Back to white.
pause 4
say Bright sparkling green.
pause 5
say Back to white.
pause 4
say Brilliant blue.
pause 5
say Back to white.
pause 4
say Bright sparkling red.
pause 5
say And back now to sparkling white.
pause 6
say Hold it firmly. It's yours — you created it, and you control it.
pause 6
say Now make it flash. On, then off. Slowly at first.
pause 6
say Faster now. On and off, faster and faster, until you can no longer tell the moments it's off — until it looks like one solid, smooth bar of light again, even though it's still pulsing.
hold 20
say Now release the bar. Move back from it a little, and just feel the energy radiating from it. It's yours — become comfortable with it.
pause 10
say Release it fully, and let it float free. It will stay here, ready, whenever you want it again.
pause 8
